WEBVTT

cue0133426
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:30.000
The

cue0133427
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:52.700
This is the law. You obey it or else. That is the basis. He says, you do it or else. That is the vision. Then there is a more sophisticated approach. Judaism does not believe in neither of these ideas.

cue0133428
00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:56.580
He reveals himself in Mount Sinai.

cue0133429
00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:00.140
And he says, listen, I have a deal for you.

cue0133430
00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:02.180
We're going to study it. We're going to read it.

cue0133431
00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:04.040
The deal is as follows.

cue0133432
00:01:04.920 --> 00:01:07.020
I have certain sects or rules.

cue0133433
00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:09.640
If you accept them,

cue0133434
00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:13.620
then you accept my laws,

cue0133435
00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.100
and you live by those laws,

cue0133436
00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:18.780
then I'm going to protect you,

cue0133437
00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.720
and I'm going to take care of you.

cue0133438
00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:39.040
It is an alliance. It is a covenant. It is a mutually agreed upon covenant. And therefore, in Harsinai, the law is presented. Do you want it? Yes or no? It's up to you.

cue0133439
00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.320
we accepted it, we sealed the covenant,

cue0133440
00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:48.220
and therefore it becomes the law because we said,

cue0133441
00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:51.740
We accepted it.

cue0133442
00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:57.260
And we become God's chosen people because we chose to be his people.

cue0133443
00:01:58.140 --> 00:02:01.200
And therefore God will protect us in a special manner

cue0133444
00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:05.120
and will bestow upon us certain special graces

cue0133445
00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:10.760
because we accept it out of our free choice.

cue0133446
00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:13.480
It's Tora.

cue0133447
00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:15.440
What do we say?

cue0133448
00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:17.220
أَشَرْ بَحَارْ بَعْنُو

cue0133449
00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.620
مِنْ كُلْهَا عَمِيمٌ

cue0133450
00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:19.740
God chose us.

cue0133451
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.220
It's a question of choosing.

cue0133452
00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.800
The best example,

cue0133453
