cue0133455
00:02:30.220 --> 00:02:32.100
You don't have to marry this man.

cue0133456
00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:34.620
He doesn't have to marry this woman.

cue0133457
00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:39.660
Both together they make a belief, they make a covenant.

cue0133458
00:02:40.300 --> 00:02:47.260
And because they make a covenant between themselves, there are certain stipulations, rules,

cue0133459
00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:49.920
